  "goodToKnow": "Die Riege is a squad, originally of gymnasts in German Turnvereine, the gymnastics clubs founded in the 19th century by Friedrich Ludwig Jahn. Figuratively, it's a group of people: die alte Riege (the old guard), eine Riege junger Politiker. Synonyms: die Gruppe, das Team, die Garde. Plural: die Riegen."
